CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/i/b com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/mod/Mod
	COMMENT One installed mod (UNRESOLVED NAME - left obfuscated): title/path/hash/description fields, reads "mod-info.txt" via IniFile ([mod] title/description/minVersion, [music] sourceFolder/whenUsingUnitsFromThisMod_playExclusively/addToNormalPlaylist), music .ogg list, steam.dat workshop id read/write, error/warning accumulators, enabled/disabled flags, delete and memory-usage reporting ("Mod: '%s' - Memory use:..."). Comparable by sort index then title. Likely original name Mod, but no mod package exists in the iOS symbols list -> intentionally not renamed.
